                                "events",
                                "parse"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Parse natural language expense text into structured data.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `text` (string, required): Natural language description of the expense/income\n- `current_date` (string, optional): ISO 8601 date string for relative date parsing\n\n**Response:**\n- `success` (boolean): Whether the parsing was successful\n- `data` (object): Parsed event data including amount, currency, description, date, type, confidence\n- `error` (string): Error message if parsing failed\n\n**Examples:**\n- \"100 USD for yesterday's dinner\"\n- \"3500 MXN for a new cheap cellphone next year\"\n- \"12000 euros in 10 monthly installments for my new bike\""
                    },
                    "response": [
